{
  "title": "Juicy Portuguese Chicken Stew",
  "description": "A malty and tender Portuguese dish featuring tahini paste, cooked in a clay pot, perfect for a post-workout meal. This Mediterranean-friendly stew is full of flavor and nutrients.",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
  "diet": [
